            "custom_liquid": "{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'de' %}\n<div class=\"site-card\">\n  <div class=\"site-card__text\">\n    <p>Du hast einen Defekt, Materialfehler oder ein Problem mit einem Produkt festgestellt?</p>\n    <p>Bitte nutze unser Reklamationsformular, damit wir Deine Anfrage schnell und strukturiert prüfen können. Je genauer die Angaben sind, desto schneller können wir Dir weiterhelfen.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"site-card__actions\">\n    <a href=\"/pages/produktreklamation\" class=\"button\">Zur Reklamation</a>\n    <a href=\"/pages/contact#contact-form\" class=\"button button--secondary\">Kontaktformular</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n{% elsif request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %}\n\n<div class=\"site-card\">\n  <div class=\"site-card__text\">\n    <p>Have you noticed a defect, material issue, or problem with a product?</p>\n    <p>Please use our complaint form so we can review your request quickly and efficiently. The more detailed your information, the faster we can assist you.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"site-card__actions\">\n    <a href=\"/pages/produktreklamation\" class=\"button\">Submit a complaint</a>\n    <a href=\"/pages/contact#contact-form\" class=\"button button--secondary\">Contact form</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n{% endif %}",
