        "collapsible_item_XxJx3b": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "ruler",
            "heading": "Größen / Produktberatung",
            "content": "",
            "custom_liquid": "{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'de' %}\n<div class=\"site-card\">\n  <div class=\"site-card__text\">\n    <p>Du bist unsicher, welche Größe oder welches Modell passt?</p>\n\n    <p>Unsere Produkte sind in Damen- und Unisex-Modelle unterteilt. Damenmodelle sind geschnitten. Unisex-Modelle haben einen geraden Schnitt. Herren wählen ihre Größe, Damen wählen bei Unisex-Modellen oft eine Größe kleiner.</p>\n\n    <p>Wenn Du unter einer Jacke oder Weste zusätzliche Schichten tragen möchtest, wähle im Zweifel die größere Größe.</p>\n\n    <p>Unsere Größentabellen zeigen die Maße der Kleidungsstücke, nicht die Körpermaße. Vergleiche die Maße mit einem Kleidungsstück, das Dir passt. Wenn Du anhand Deiner Körpermaße auswählst, plane ausreichend Bewegungsfreiheit ein.</p>\n\n    <p>Wir haben kein Ladengeschäft. Zur Orientierung kannst Du Kundenfotos auf unserem Instagram-Profil in den Highlights ansehen.</p>\n\n    <p>Wenn Du zwischen zwei Größen schwankst, kannst Du zwei Größen bestellen und eine zurücksenden.</p>\n\n    <p>Pflegehinweise findest Du in der Produktbeschreibung und auf dem Etikett. Wenn ein Produkt ausverkauft ist, kannst Du Deine E-Mail-Adresse auf der Produktseite hinterlegen und wirst informiert, sobald es wieder verfügbar ist.</p>\n\n    <p>Wenn Du unsicher bist, kontaktiere uns.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"product-help-grid\">\n    <article class=\"product-help-card\">\n      <h3 class=\"h6 font-heading\">IQ Performance Pro – Cobra</h3>\n      <p>Schritt-für-Schritt Anleitung zum Anziehen des Geschirrs.</p>\n\n      <img\n        src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0625/2806/1688/files/IQ-Performance-Pro-installation-guide_5b25b192-2cef-4a81-b09d-201e435a1101.png\"\n        alt=\"IQ Performance Pro Anleitung\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        width=\"1200\"\n        height=\"800\"\n      >\n\n      <a\n        href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0625/2806/1688/files/IQ-Performance-Pro-installation-guide_5b25b192-2cef-4a81-b09d-201e435a1101.png\"\n        target=\"_blank\"\n        rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n        class=\"btn btn--secondary w-full link-as-button\"\n      >\n        <span>Anleitung öffnen</span>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"product-help-card\">\n      <h3 class=\"h6 font-heading\">Hundesportweste 3.0</h3>\n      <p>Erklärungsvideo mit den wichtigsten Funktionen.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"product-help-video\">\n        <iframe\n          src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/itbr36woVvk\"\n          title=\"Hundesportweste 3.0 Video\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n          allowfullscreen>\n        </iframe>\n      </div>\n\n      <a\n        href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=itbr36woVvk\"\n        target=\"_blank\"\n        rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n        class=\"btn btn--secondary w-full link-as-button\"\n      >\n        <span>Video öffnen</span>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"product-help-card\">\n      <h3 class=\"h6 font-heading\">IQ Wurfversteck mit Magnettasche</h3>\n      <p>Videoanleitung zum Aufbau und zur Anwendung.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"product-help-video\">\n        <iframe\n          src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/2JJiDt2I02k\"\n          title=\"Wurfversteck Anleitung\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n          allowfullscreen>\n        </iframe>\n      </div>\n\n      <a\n        href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2JJiDt2I02k\"\n        target=\"_blank\"\n        rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n        class=\"btn btn--secondary w-full link-as-button\"\n      >\n        <span>Video öffnen</span>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"site-card__actions\">\n    <a href=\"/pages/contact#contact-form\" class=\"button button--secondary\">\n      Kontaktformular\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n{% elsif request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %}\n\n<div class=\"site-card\">\n  <div class=\"site-card__text\">\n    <p>Not sure which size or model fits you?</p>\n\n    <p>Our products are divided into women's and unisex models. Women's models are tailored, while unisex models have a straight cut. Men choose their usual size, while women often choose one size smaller for unisex models.</p>\n\n    <p>If you plan to wear additional layers under a jacket or vest, choose the larger size if in doubt.</p>\n\n    <p>Our size charts show garment measurements, not body measurements. Compare them with a piece of clothing that fits you well. If you select based on body measurements, allow enough room for movement.</p>\n\n    <p>We do not have a physical store. For reference, you can check customer photos on our Instagram profile in the highlights.</p>\n\n    <p>If you are between two sizes, you can order both and return one.</p>\n\n    <p>Care instructions can be found in the product description and on the label. If a product is sold out, you can leave your email address on the product page to be notified when it becomes available again.</p>\n\n    <p>If you are unsure, feel free to contact us.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"product-help-grid\">\n    <article class=\"product-help-card\">\n      <h3 class=\"h6 font-heading\">IQ Performance Pro – Cobra</h3>\n      <p>Step-by-step guide on how to put on the harness.</p>\n\n      <img\n        src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0625/2806/1688/files/IQ-Performance-Pro-installation-guide_5b25b192-2cef-4a81-b09d-201e435a1101.png\"\n        alt=\"IQ Performance Pro guide\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        width=\"1200\"\n        height=\"800\"\n      >\n\n      <a\n        href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0625/2806/1688/files/IQ-Performance-Pro-installation-guide_5b25b192-2cef-4a81-b09d-201e435a1101.png\"\n        target=\"_blank\"\n        rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n        class=\"btn btn--secondary w-full link-as-button\"\n      >\n        <span>Open guide</span>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"product-help-card\">\n      <h3 class=\"h6 font-heading\">Dog Sport Vest 3.0</h3>\n      <p>Explainer video with key features.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"product-help-video\">\n        <iframe\n          src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/itbr36woVvk\"\n          title=\"Dog Sport Vest 3.0 video\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n          allowfullscreen>\n        </iframe>\n      </div>\n\n      <a\n        href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=itbr36woVvk\"\n        target=\"_blank\"\n        rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n        class=\"btn btn--secondary w-full link-as-button\"\n      >\n        <span>Watch video</span>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"product-help-card\">\n      <h3 class=\"h6 font-heading\">IQ Throw Hide with Magnetic Pocket</h3>\n      <p>Video guide for setup and usage.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"product-help-video\">\n        <iframe\n          src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/2JJiDt2I02k\"\n          title=\"Throw hide guide\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n          allowfullscreen>\n        </iframe>\n      </div>\n\n      <a\n        href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2JJiDt2I02k\"\n        target=\"_blank\"\n        rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n        class=\"btn btn--secondary w-full link-as-button\"\n      >\n        <span>Watch video</span>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"site-card__actions\">\n    <a href=\"/pages/contact#contact-form\" class=\"button button--secondary\">\n      Contact form\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n{% endif %}",
